    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f5bf9dbf-f069-401e-9db4-7544433aacad-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 173px;\" /><br /><br />We can assume that reflected wave is due to image of <math> <mtext>B</mtext> </math> coming with same speed in opposite direction<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cf40d10a-3d87-4fe1-9253-fa47020a011c-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 86px;\" /><br />Observer<br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>320</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>320</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8000</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>310</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8000</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8000</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>8516</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>Hz</mi></math>",
